{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>每次到收銀檯前才手忙腳亂翻找會員卡與優惠券？Checkout Deck 把每間商店或日常流程需要的卡片整理成專屬卡序，結帳時依序打開，最後直接跳轉至付款應用程式。無論是經常逛超市、便利店還是連鎖店，這款工具都能讓付款流程更順暢。原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>結帳卡序自訂一按即開</h2>\n<p>可為每間商店建立專屬卡序，把會員卡、優惠券與付款方式按使用次序排列，結帳時依序打開，再跳轉至付款應用程式。由相片匯入卡面會辨識條碼並建議卡名，加入店名關鍵字後，在附近會提示合用卡片。小工具讓常用卡序一按即開，結帳模式放大條碼並避免螢幕休眠。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-167-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-168-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-169-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-170-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-171-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/09/1290x2796bb-172-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：Checkout Deck</li>\n<li>應用類別：Lifestyle</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-09-23T17:57:59.022156+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":314,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}